  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-76",
  "title": "docket.tv | Monetization",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "docket.tv | Monetization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The membership fee revenue-sharing model presents an innovative, aligned-incentive opportunity for [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/). Here's a structured analysis and implementation plan:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Core Value Proposition**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**\"We succeed when your community grows\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Replace upfront costs with partnership: Broadcasters pay nothing to use [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/), but we take 3-5% of membership fees processed through our platform. This creates:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Zero-risk adoption** for cash-strapped public access stations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Scalable revenue** tied to broadcaster success"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Built-in advocacy** (stations incentivized to promote membership signups via Docket)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Advantages**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Market Differentiation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Unlike SaaS competitors charging flat fees (e.g. $49-$199/mo), Docket becomes a *profit partner* rather than a cost center."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Network Effects**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Successful stations attract more members → Higher Docket revenue → More platform improvements → Better tools for all."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Sticky Ecosystem**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Membership management integration makes switching platforms operationally painful once adopted."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 1: Hybrid Model Launch**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Free Tier**: Basic CMS + 5% membership fee cut"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Pro Tier** ($99/mo): Premium features + reduced 3% fee"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Enterprise**: Custom pricing for large networks"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Rationale*: Caters to risk-averse stations while incentivizing upgrades to lower commission rates."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Critical Technical Components**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **PCI-Compliant Payment Hub**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- White-label Stripe integration with auto-payouts to broadcaster accounts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Tax handling (Salesforce/Vertex API) for global compliance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Member Portal Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Exclusive content gating"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Automated renewal reminders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Discord-style community spaces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Success Analytics**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Real-time dashboards showing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Using Docket tools increased your membership conversions by 22% this month\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Risk Mitigation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Revenue Volatility**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Minimum Floor**: $20/mo per station (covers base infrastructure costs)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Upsell Opportunities**: Add-ons like premium support (15% fee) or merch fulfillment"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Broadcaster Trust**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Transparent Reporting**: Show exact fee calculations + comparative benchmarks"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Exit Clause**: Allow full member data export if switching platforms"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Regulatory Compliance**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Partner with legaltech startup (e.g. Termly) for automated ToS updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Region-specific compliance dashboards for GDPR/CCPA"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Market Validation Steps**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Pilot with Speak MPLS**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Test fee structure impact on their membership growth"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Document workflow improvements (e.g., \"Saved 11 staff hours/month\")"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Competitor Analysis**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Compare against Patreon (5-12% fees) and MemberPress ($299/yr license)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Emphasize Docket's public-access specialization in marketing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Early Adopter Incentives**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Waive fees for 6 months if stations migrate 80%+ members to Docket"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Long-Term Vision**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Monetization** (Ethical Approach):"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Aggregate anonymized viewership trends → Sell insights to local advertisers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"35% of Minneapolis members watch environmental shows - target your eco-business ads here\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Grant Partnership Program**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Become required infrastructure for FCC community media grants"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This model transforms [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/) from a software vendor to a growth partner, creating shared success while addressing public media's unique financial constraints. Immediate next step: Build Stripe integration prototype and test pricing psychology with 3-5 small stations."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
